      "citation": "all 2^128 addresses usable, deterministic, error-free by construction (classical; 128 = 2^7, the 7-qubit fold — theorem handle_capacity_is_quantum_by_architecture); never a quantum computer — measured by this generator: full-1693-theorem receipt sweep, per-verify decade 10^3 ns on the build host (raw figure in the build log only — a decade reseals, a raw number drifts) — NOT VERIFIED SINCE PUBLICATION: no date recorded for when this figure was last checked against its source"
